  "details": "Won’t let me load it at all. Game opens, “loads” world, opens world then says unavailable. I uninstalled and reinstalled to clear any caches then picked the main VRC homeworld, get booted still. \n\nThought I was banned or something but account works fine and have not gotten any information about any bans. Friend of mine said it was due to an update or rework on the age verification system but I haven’t seen or gotten anything about any rework. Tried PC, didn’t work either. \n\nLong story short, Game opens and plays, but can’t play at all and just stuck in a loop of “join, error, leave, repeat.”",
